main.cpp
--cpp20
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ more-constrained overload must win: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
